meta {
  name: Get Booking Request
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/booking-requests/{{bookingRequestId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  One request plus `consent` (policy version and acceptance time) and `candidates`: the patients
  sharing its verified contact, computed now. Active records come first (at most one for an email, several
  for a shared number), then deleted ones. `contactChannel` says how the patient proved who they are:
  `email`, null for a phone session, or `verifiedPhone`. `phone` is typed and never proven.
  `unverifiedMatch` marks a candidate matched only by a number typed in the booking form.
  404 for another provider's request.
}
